## Server Options

```
rchess-server [OPTIONS]

--host   <addr>     Bind address                 (default: 0.0.0.0)
--port   <n>        Game TCP port                (default: 9001)
--admin  <n>        Admin dashboard HTTP port    (default: 9002)
--data   <dir>      Room persistence directory   (default: ./rchess_data)
--pw     <pass>     Require password from clients
--apw    <pass>     Admin dashboard password
--name   <str>      Server display name
--motd   <str>      Message of the day (shown to connecting clients)
--ttl    <mins>     Room TTL after both disconnect (default: 120)
--public <host>     Public hostname/IP for invite links
--fresh             Delete all saved rooms on startup
--help              Show help
```

**Config file** (auto-created): `~/.config/rchess/server.toml`

