## Admin Dashboard

Open in browser: `http://server:9002`  (add `?pw=yourpassword` if set)

### Features

| Feature | How |
|---|---|
| View all active rooms | Dashboard homepage |
| Kick a room instantly | ⚡ Kick button — both players disconnected + state cleared |
| Send message to a room | 📨 Msg button — appears in their chat as server message |
| Broadcast to all rooms | Broadcast input at top of page |
| Update MOTD live | MOTD field — no restart needed |
| Set admin notes | Note field — internal only |
| Clear persisted rooms | 🗑 button — deletes .room files (doesn't affect live games) |
| View event log | Bottom of dashboard — last 80 events |
| REST API | `/api/status` `/api/rooms` `/api/log` |

### REST API

```bash
BASE=http://server:9002

# Server status
curl "$BASE/api/status?pw=yourpw"

# List rooms
curl "$BASE/api/rooms?pw=yourpw"

# Kick a room
curl -X POST "$BASE/api/rooms/ABCDEF/kick?pw=yourpw"

# Broadcast message
curl -X POST "$BASE/api/broadcast?pw=yourpw" -d "Server restarting in 5 minutes"

# Send message to specific room
curl -X POST "$BASE/api/rooms/ABCDEF/message?pw=yourpw" -d "You're playing well!"

# Update MOTD
curl -X POST "$BASE/api/motd?pw=yourpw" -d "Server maintenance tonight at 22:00"
```

