## Firewall / Port Forwarding

| Port | Protocol | Purpose |
|------|----------|---------|
| 9001 | TCP | Game traffic (must be open to clients) |
| 9002 | TCP | Admin dashboard (keep private or firewall) |

```bash
# UFW (Ubuntu)
sudo ufw allow 9001/tcp
# Only allow admin from your IP:
sudo ufw allow from YOUR_IP to any port 9002

# Or use an SSH tunnel for admin (safest):
ssh -L 9002:localhost:9002 user@server
# Then open http://localhost:9002
```

