## Server Config File Reference

`~/.config/rchess/server.toml`

```toml
# Network
host             = "0.0.0.0"    # bind address
port             = 9001          # game TCP port
admin_port       = 9002          # admin dashboard port

# Public address embedded in invite links
# Leave empty for auto-detect (LAN IP for local, set for internet)
public_host      = "chess.example.com"

# Security (leave empty = no password)
server_password  = ""            # required by all clients
admin_password   = "secret123"   # admin panel

# Limits
max_rooms        = 200
max_conns_per_ip = 20            # per minute
room_ttl_mins    = 120           # room kept N minutes after both disconnect

# Data
data_dir         = "./rchess_data"

# Identity
server_name      = "My Chess Server"
motd             = "Good luck and have fun!"
```

